entries.definition_en:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.8.25; 
 son of: Shashak (H8349); 
 brother of: Ishpan (H3473), Eber (H5677J), Eliel (H0447I), Abdon (H5658I), Zichri (H2147I), Hanan (H2605), Hananiah (H2608O), Elam (H5867), Anthothijah (H6070) and Penuel (H6439I) 
 § Iphedeiah = "Jehovah will redeem"
 a descendant of Benjamin and of the family of Shashak

A king of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 2Ki.21.18; 
 son of: Manasseh (H4519H) and Meshullemeth (H4922); married to Jedidah (H3040); 
 father of: Josiah (H2977); also called Amos at Mat.1.10; 
 § Amon = "skilled workman" or "master workman"
1) a king of Judah, son of Manasseh
2) a governor of Samaria
3) a descendant of a servant of Solomon

People descended from Sheba, a man of the Cushites living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.10.7; 
 son of: Raamah (H7484); 
 brother of: Dedan (H1719B); also called Sabean at Job.1.15; 3x
Group of she.va (שְׁבָא "Sheba" H7614) 
 § Sabeans = "drunkards"
 the people of Seba
